@pandablessing/dsh-user-sync README · 前置条件：- DSH `>= 0.2.0-rc.2`（Node `>= 22`）；
- 一个可用的 DeepSeek 账号（用于自动配对，不需要注册任何运营方账号）；
- 桌面端：Windows / macOS 已验证，Linux 未验证。

@pandablessing/dsh-user-sync README · 重启 DSH → 设置 → 设置同步 → 同意并启用 → 上传用户配置：```

换到新机器，同样装一次 → 设置同步 → **从远端同步**。

> 包名必须用 `@pandablessing/dsh-user-sync`；若装过旧名 `dsh-user-sync`，先删掉旧条目（junction / dependencies / bundles）再装，否则会重复注册面板。

@pandablessing/dsh-user-sync README · 重启 DSH 后面板消失；本地状态在 ~/.dsh/user-sync/（可保留或手动删除）：```

开发安装用 `scripts\uninstall-dev.cmd` 回滚。

**回滚到应用前**：每次「从远端同步」前都会生成 `pre-restore` 快照（`~/.dsh/user-sync/pre-restore/`），把快照里的文件拷回即可恢复；也可以从远端重新应用一份更早的包。

@pandablessing/dsh-user-sync README · Requirements：- DSH `>= 0.2.0-rc.2` (Node `>= 22`)
- A DeepSeek account (used for automatic pairing; no operator account required)
- Desktop: verified on Windows / macOS; Linux not yet verified

@pandablessing/dsh-user-sync README · Restart DSH → Settings → Settings Sync → Accept & enable → Upload config：```

On a new machine: install the same way → Settings Sync → **Sync from remote**.

> Use the npm package name `@pandablessing/dsh-user-sync`; remove any old `dsh-user-sync` entry first to avoid duplicate panels.

@pandablessing/dsh-user-sync README · Uninstall & rollback：```bash
cd ~/.dsh/profiles/desktop
pnpm remove @pandablessing/dsh-user-sync

@pandablessing/dsh-user-sync README · Quotas & limits：- **Only one package per account**; max **10 MB** per package (so effectively 10 MB per account);
- Only one package is kept remotely (upload overwrites); rollback relies on local `pre-restore` snapshots;
- Jianguoyun (WebDAV) has per-account traffic quotas;
- Single-node server; feedback endpoint is rate-limited in memory.

